WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
video file & english subs: Safex

00:00:05.439 --> 00:00:08.875
As Tom wished,
the engagement was canceled.

00:00:09.209 --> 00:00:14.704
Candy happily
went back to Pony's Home.

00:00:21.922 --> 00:00:27.883
Mr. Sailor on the hill.

00:00:39.439 --> 00:00:41.669
Thank you so much for your help.

00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:45.311
I was glad to see your fiance, too!

00:00:46.613 --> 00:00:47.601
Stop teasing me!

00:00:47.751 --> 00:00:51.975
I am talking about Father's health.

00:00:52.125 --> 00:00:54.085
I am a practice nurse.

00:00:55.222 --> 00:00:57.486
It's my job to send him to the hospital
as soon as possible.

00:00:57.858 --> 00:00:59.382
That's good.

00:01:06.466 --> 00:01:07.890
I am back!

00:01:10.003 --> 00:01:11.432
How come nobody is here?

00:01:11.705 --> 00:01:13.432
Strange.

00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:16.031
Sister Pony.

00:01:21.014 --> 00:01:23.003
Is Pony's Home closed?

00:01:23.153 --> 00:01:25.217
Tom, stop joking!

00:01:26.486 --> 00:01:27.885
Sorry.

00:01:31.191 --> 00:01:32.681
There is a letter.

00:01:35.295 --> 00:01:39.123
We are helping at Mr. Cartwright's farm.

00:01:39.273 --> 00:01:43.060
Candy, please watch the house for us.

00:01:43.210 --> 00:01:45.429
I see. It scared me.

00:01:45.579 --> 00:01:46.931
That's why.

00:01:47.081 --> 00:01:47.966
I am going home.

00:01:48.975 --> 00:01:50.370
You don't want to take a rest?

00:01:51.144 --> 00:01:54.910
My farm is busy, too!
Say ''Hi!'' to Sister Pony for me.

00:01:56.082 --> 00:01:59.711
- Thanks for bringing me back!
- Good-bye!

00:02:01.888 --> 00:02:03.315
Good-bye!

00:02:08.795 --> 00:02:10.456
Terry!

00:02:15.302 --> 00:02:16.860
Terry!

00:02:21.675 --> 00:02:23.108
Terry!

00:02:26.613 --> 00:02:27.875
Terry!

00:02:28.548 --> 00:02:30.277
Is it Terry?

00:02:36.957 --> 00:02:38.322
You are....

00:02:42.262 --> 00:02:44.987
I am not Terry, sorry.

00:02:45.137 --> 00:02:47.498
- Candy!
- Cookie!

00:02:49.202 --> 00:02:51.062
Finally you became a sailor!

00:02:51.212 --> 00:02:52.563
Yeah! Finally.

00:02:52.713 --> 00:02:53.929
Congratulations!

00:02:54.079 --> 00:02:57.834
I work on the Sea Gull.

00:02:57.984 --> 00:03:00.003
The Sea Gull?

00:03:00.180 --> 00:03:01.668
I miss it so much.

00:03:01.818 --> 00:03:06.115
I came to Pony's Home to see you
as soon as I got off the ship.

00:03:06.653 --> 00:03:08.218
Welcome.

00:03:09.623 --> 00:03:12.021
How can a minor smoke?

00:03:12.492 --> 00:03:17.585
I am just pretending to smoke.
It's cool.

00:03:17.735 --> 00:03:19.255
Come on.

00:03:27.841 --> 00:03:29.832
Really?

00:03:31.478 --> 00:03:33.207
It's so cool.

00:03:34.681 --> 00:03:36.006
Looks like a sailor.

00:03:36.156 --> 00:03:39.381
Not just looks like,
Cookie is a real sailor.

00:03:39.986 --> 00:03:41.476
A kid can be a sailor?

00:03:42.555 --> 00:03:44.155
I am already fifteen.

00:03:44.324 --> 00:03:45.791
Jimmy said that.

00:03:48.762 --> 00:03:52.693
Cookie is an orphan like us.

00:03:53.199 --> 00:03:54.393
Really?

00:03:55.101 --> 00:03:57.729
Tell us about the ship.

00:03:57.971 --> 00:04:01.372
Alright, let me tell you a story
about the Atlantic Ocean.

00:04:04.678 --> 00:04:06.571
I want to be a sailor, too.

00:04:06.721 --> 00:04:08.614
About three years ago....

00:04:08.782 --> 00:04:10.838
It's very cool!

00:04:10.988 --> 00:04:12.940
A brave young man.

00:04:13.090 --> 00:04:16.215
Sister Pony,
can Cookie stay here tonight?

00:04:16.465 --> 00:04:21.473
Sure.
The kids must be very excited about it.

00:04:26.333 --> 00:04:28.893
Can I wear it?

00:04:31.604 --> 00:04:34.093
Smells like a sailor.

00:04:34.243 --> 00:04:37.836
I want to wear it, too....

00:04:39.079 --> 00:04:40.637
Take turns.

00:04:40.987 --> 00:04:42.710
Line up.

00:04:45.418 --> 00:04:47.215
Salute!

00:04:50.223 --> 00:04:52.487
No, you need to straighten your arm.

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:55.621
Straighten it!

00:04:57.030 --> 00:04:57.822
Ok, put down your hands.

00:04:58.072 --> 00:05:02.263
Cookie has grown up.
He doesn't look like a kid now.

00:05:06.873 --> 00:05:08.766
What's wrong, Mina, Kurin?

00:05:12.712 --> 00:05:14.577
Somebody is here.

00:05:14.748 --> 00:05:16.215
Mr. Matthew!

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:18.581
Thank you.

00:05:18.952 --> 00:05:20.613
Candy.

00:05:22.088 --> 00:05:23.512
What's wrong?

00:05:23.762 --> 00:05:26.383
Is that young man Cookie?

00:05:26.633 --> 00:05:28.253
Yes, what's wrong?

00:05:28.503 --> 00:05:32.396
Some strangers are looking for him
in the village.

00:05:33.433 --> 00:05:34.359
Who?

00:05:34.509 --> 00:05:38.062
They didn't tell us their names.

00:05:38.471 --> 00:05:40.632
They are going to find it here eventually.

00:05:41.307 --> 00:05:42.604
Here?

00:05:51.584 --> 00:05:54.144
What do you want to tell me, Candy?

00:05:54.320 --> 00:05:57.453
Is it about brother Terry?

00:05:57.623 --> 00:05:59.022
Terry?

00:05:59.191 --> 00:06:03.218
I didn't find him.

00:06:04.230 --> 00:06:07.631
Cookie,
there are people looking for you.

00:06:08.134 --> 00:06:09.692
Are they here?

00:06:10.236 --> 00:06:12.179
Just around here.

00:06:12.329 --> 00:06:15.330
Candy.
Don't tell anyone that I am here.

00:06:16.008 --> 00:06:18.868
Why are you hiding?

00:06:19.018 --> 00:06:20.601
I am not.

00:06:20.751 --> 00:06:24.581
Why are you sneaking around?

00:06:25.117 --> 00:06:27.479
Candy, I left the Sea Gull.

00:06:28.654 --> 00:06:31.417
Didn't you want to be a sailor?

00:06:35.361 --> 00:06:37.761
Not just the Sea Gull.

00:06:38.597 --> 00:06:40.697
Cookie, that wound....

00:06:42.001 --> 00:06:44.429
The sailors did it.

00:06:52.044 --> 00:06:54.012
They are so mean?

00:06:54.947 --> 00:06:57.206
Why?

00:06:57.356 --> 00:06:59.141
Because I am an easy target.

00:06:59.291 --> 00:07:04.005
I am an orphan, I am all by myself.

00:07:07.126 --> 00:07:08.257
Ok.

00:07:10.596 --> 00:07:13.588
Aren't they good guys?

00:07:14.066 --> 00:07:17.399
They treated us like guests, when
we were trying to escape on the sea,

00:07:17.937 --> 00:07:19.729
Did Captain Nieven stop them?

00:07:19.879 --> 00:07:21.370
He pretended he didn't see it.

00:07:22.608 --> 00:07:26.271
Unbelievable!
How could Captain Nieven....

00:07:26.679 --> 00:07:29.635
- Alright.
- What should we do?

00:07:30.085 --> 00:07:32.040
Everyone gather here!

00:07:32.317 --> 00:07:33.511
Ok.

00:07:42.094 --> 00:07:45.621
Bummer!
Where did Cookie go?

00:07:46.298 --> 00:07:48.753
Let's go back, brother!

00:07:48.903 --> 00:07:51.700
Let's look for it for another while.

00:07:55.240 --> 00:07:58.971
Hey, little guy!
Where is Pony's Home?

00:08:00.545 --> 00:08:05.138
A place for orphans.

00:08:05.288 --> 00:08:06.710
Say it again?

00:08:06.860 --> 00:08:10.982
A place for orphans.

00:08:12.424 --> 00:08:13.914
Go!

00:08:14.793 --> 00:08:15.983
What are they doing?

00:08:16.295 --> 00:08:17.421
Wait a minute!

00:08:27.939 --> 00:08:29.664
Let me go!

00:08:30.114 --> 00:08:31.504
Stop it!

00:08:37.249 --> 00:08:38.614
Jimmy!

00:08:40.519 --> 00:08:43.008
No!

00:08:43.158 --> 00:08:45.177
Help!

00:08:45.727 --> 00:08:47.499
Mr. Viva! Mr. Vokado!

00:08:47.649 --> 00:08:48.888
Jimmy, stop!

00:08:49.394 --> 00:08:50.361
Mina.

00:09:01.306 --> 00:09:02.539
Take it easy.

00:09:07.946 --> 00:09:10.503
These children are so mean.

00:09:10.653 --> 00:09:12.807
Sorry.

00:09:12.957 --> 00:09:15.819
Jimmy, apologize to the guests.

00:09:16.722 --> 00:09:17.743
No!

00:09:17.893 --> 00:09:22.816
Jimmy, you were rude to the guests
on their first visit.

00:09:23.061 --> 00:09:26.162
Sister, we want to revenge for Cookie.

00:09:26.798 --> 00:09:29.932
Cookie?
Candy, is Cookie here?

00:09:31.169 --> 00:09:32.727
Yes.

00:09:33.338 --> 00:09:34.360
Finally.

00:09:34.510 --> 00:09:37.601
You came for Cookie, right?

00:09:38.009 --> 00:09:40.014
John, it's rude.

00:09:40.384 --> 00:09:45.103
But, they were mean to Cookie
because he was an orphan.

00:09:45.453 --> 00:09:49.250
John, you listened to
my conversation with Cookie?

00:09:49.754 --> 00:09:51.979
Anyway, it's unforgivable.

00:09:52.129 --> 00:09:54.217
Yes.

00:09:54.626 --> 00:09:56.355
What's the noise?

00:09:56.728 --> 00:09:57.884
Candy!

00:09:58.034 --> 00:10:01.488
Cookie told you
he was beaten because he was an orphan?

00:10:02.167 --> 00:10:03.156
Yes.

00:10:03.768 --> 00:10:05.492
This guy....

00:10:05.642 --> 00:10:07.332
- He lied?
- No!

00:10:07.539 --> 00:10:11.438
He was undisciplined and impatient.
We didn't know what to do with him.

00:10:12.977 --> 00:10:14.302
What did you say?

00:10:14.452 --> 00:10:15.606
Jimmy!

00:10:16.381 --> 00:10:18.015
Stop it!

00:10:18.516 --> 00:10:19.504
Sister!

00:10:19.654 --> 00:10:24.778
Did you teach children at Pony's Home
to attack the guests?

00:10:26.124 --> 00:10:27.550
I...

00:10:27.700 --> 00:10:29.092
Let's go, Viva!

00:10:29.928 --> 00:10:31.583
But, brother...

00:10:32.033 --> 00:10:36.954
Candy, tell Cookie,
he doesn't have to come back.

00:10:37.104 --> 00:10:38.592
Mr. Vokado.

00:10:54.185 --> 00:10:57.013
This guy Cookie
has no gratitude for our grace.

00:10:57.555 --> 00:11:01.184
If it weren't for Captain Nieven....

00:11:06.397 --> 00:11:07.919
Candy, why did you...

00:11:08.069 --> 00:11:09.520
I have taken the shortcut.

00:11:09.670 --> 00:11:12.159
Candy,
I don't want to explain it to you.

00:11:21.913 --> 00:11:25.110
Cookie was really beaten very often.

00:11:39.297 --> 00:11:40.958
Idiot!

00:11:41.366 --> 00:11:43.874
This is how you want to be a sailor?

00:11:49.140 --> 00:11:52.732
But, they didn't have to do that.

00:11:52.882 --> 00:11:56.439
Candy, you are a practice nurse.

00:11:57.549 --> 00:12:01.276
What's the most important thing
in the world?

00:12:01.786 --> 00:12:03.481
People's lives.

00:12:03.955 --> 00:12:05.946
If....

00:12:09.327 --> 00:12:11.818
If the Sea Gull had sunk at that time,

00:12:12.263 --> 00:12:15.790
many people would have died.

00:12:18.436 --> 00:12:21.797
I was beaten really badly before, too.

00:12:21.947 --> 00:12:24.930
This is what
every sailor should go through.

00:12:25.080 --> 00:12:26.998
This guy Cookie

00:12:27.148 --> 00:12:30.135
thought we beat him
because he was an orphan.

00:12:30.285 --> 00:12:35.049
Candy, Captain Nieven
sent us to look for Cookie.

00:12:36.187 --> 00:12:37.709
Captain Nieven?

00:12:37.859 --> 00:12:40.547
It's the same for every man on the sea.

00:12:40.697 --> 00:12:45.925
We have no parents, no brothers.
Everyone is alone.

00:12:52.269 --> 00:12:56.763
Mr. Vokado,
please give Cookie one more chance.

00:12:57.113 --> 00:12:59.631
But, we can't find him.

00:13:00.081 --> 00:13:02.304
Don't worry, wait here.

00:13:02.813 --> 00:13:04.007
Candy!

00:13:06.817 --> 00:13:10.178
I see. Cookie left these things.

00:13:11.128 --> 00:13:13.782
We searched him everywhere.

00:13:13.932 --> 00:13:16.481
Jimmy, let me borrow the horse.

00:13:16.631 --> 00:13:19.460
Candy, why are you looking for Cookie?

00:13:20.297 --> 00:13:22.820
So he can go back to the ship.

00:13:22.970 --> 00:13:26.457
Poor kid, he could be beaten anytime.

00:13:26.607 --> 00:13:28.265
Let's find him first!

00:13:30.740 --> 00:13:32.799
Cookie!

00:13:35.145 --> 00:13:37.113
Cookie!

00:13:48.725 --> 00:13:51.190
Where did Cookie go?

00:14:00.337 --> 00:14:03.238
I can't find him anywhere.

00:14:06.143 --> 00:14:09.734
Sorry.
My friend is causing everyone trouble.

00:14:09.884 --> 00:14:11.609
That's ok, Candy.

00:14:11.982 --> 00:14:15.709
I haven't seen these kids
so enthusiastic for a long time.

00:14:15.859 --> 00:14:17.616
True.

00:14:17.854 --> 00:14:21.277
Candy,
Cookie is popular among the kids...

00:14:21.427 --> 00:14:23.616
not because he is a sailor.

00:14:23.766 --> 00:14:24.849
But...

00:14:24.999 --> 00:14:28.420
Cookie and you
are role models for the kids.

00:14:29.170 --> 00:14:30.429
Role models?

00:14:31.301 --> 00:14:34.793
Yes, good role models.

00:14:42.045 --> 00:14:46.709
Cookie and I
are role models for the kids?

00:14:57.661 --> 00:15:00.959
Candy, was it alright?

00:15:02.499 --> 00:15:05.058
Nursing school.

00:15:06.036 --> 00:15:09.403
That's great. Good night.

00:15:11.841 --> 00:15:13.240
Milly...

00:15:28.758 --> 00:15:31.051
Candy, we never told you this.

00:15:31.201 --> 00:15:32.652
Every time you come back,

00:15:32.902 --> 00:15:36.891
You are always the one who decides
whether the kids are happy or not.

00:15:37.041 --> 00:15:39.400
- Me?
- Yes.

00:15:39.703 --> 00:15:42.228
You are happy or not.

00:15:42.973 --> 00:15:46.206
How much you've been through.

00:15:46.409 --> 00:15:48.600
I never noticed.

00:15:49.613 --> 00:15:52.304
You are our favorite.

00:15:52.454 --> 00:15:54.207
One more thing.

00:15:54.357 --> 00:15:58.378
You have not changed.

00:15:58.922 --> 00:16:04.582
You have to tell us things about Cookie
so that we don't get worried.

00:16:05.032 --> 00:16:10.425
I always come back to Pony's Home
when I feel frustrated.

00:16:10.575 --> 00:16:12.460
I am going back to the hospital
tomorrow.

00:16:12.610 --> 00:16:16.593
Next time when I come, I will
tell you everything, both good and bad.

00:16:17.143 --> 00:16:18.938
Ok.

00:16:28.551 --> 00:16:31.543
Mina, Kurin, be good!

00:16:34.357 --> 00:16:36.086
The carriage is here!

00:16:37.060 --> 00:16:39.255
That's Tom's carriage.

00:16:42.966 --> 00:16:46.766
Cookie!

00:16:48.038 --> 00:16:49.863
What's wrong, Cookie?

00:16:50.013 --> 00:16:52.496
I found him wandering on the street
last night,

00:16:52.646 --> 00:16:54.474
and let him stay a night at my place.

00:16:57.247 --> 00:16:58.441
Candy.

00:17:00.183 --> 00:17:02.509
Are the hat and pipe still here?

00:17:02.659 --> 00:17:04.985
Are you going back to the Sea Gull?

00:17:06.422 --> 00:17:08.686
Tom was blaming me last night.

00:17:09.792 --> 00:17:14.455
How would everyone look for Cookie,
if they didn't like him?

00:17:14.805 --> 00:17:18.962
You are an orphan,
you are going to take some fists.

00:17:20.837 --> 00:17:23.962
Actually, I deserve it.

00:17:24.112 --> 00:17:26.132
- Really?
- Sorry.

00:17:26.576 --> 00:17:28.806
I lied to you.

00:17:28.978 --> 00:17:30.878
I see.

00:17:34.150 --> 00:17:38.610
Thank you. I kept
dreaming about the ship last night.

00:17:41.757 --> 00:17:44.658
Helm to the left!

00:17:45.294 --> 00:17:48.695
Can't believe you were shouting
in the middle of the night.

00:17:52.201 --> 00:17:53.691
Mr. Steve!

00:17:54.637 --> 00:17:56.036
Father.

00:17:57.907 --> 00:18:00.362
Thank you for everything
you've done to me all these times.

00:18:00.512 --> 00:18:02.918
Mr. Steve, what's wrong?

00:18:03.368 --> 00:18:06.239
I want to see you guys.

00:18:06.389 --> 00:18:08.077
I am afraid
this is going to be the last time.

00:18:10.286 --> 00:18:12.413
Come on, Father!

00:18:12.821 --> 00:18:14.880
We are just doing a regular visit
to the hospital.

00:18:15.925 --> 00:18:17.716
I know I am not going to make it.

00:18:17.866 --> 00:18:20.124
Are you cold, Mr. Steve?

00:18:20.763 --> 00:18:22.555
He is trembling because he is scared.

00:18:22.705 --> 00:18:25.934
This is my father's first time
to the hospital.

00:18:26.101 --> 00:18:29.057
Tom, let's go home! We'll go next time.

00:18:29.207 --> 00:18:30.429
No way!

00:18:30.579 --> 00:18:32.837
Mr. Steve, let me go with you.

00:18:33.175 --> 00:18:34.197
Good-bye, Sister!

00:18:34.647 --> 00:18:36.744
Take care of yourself. Good luck!

00:18:37.646 --> 00:18:39.079
Good luck, Cookie!

00:18:39.448 --> 00:18:41.075
I'll apologize to the captain.

00:18:41.884 --> 00:18:43.777
Good luck, Candy!

00:18:43.927 --> 00:18:45.786
Good luck, Cookie!

00:18:46.255 --> 00:18:50.919
Bye!

00:19:06.475 --> 00:19:08.735
Mr. Steve. Sorry for the wait.

00:19:09.211 --> 00:19:10.371
Come on, Father.

00:19:10.913 --> 00:19:13.138
Tom, thank you for doing this.

00:19:13.288 --> 00:19:14.648
Don't say that, Father.

00:19:18.153 --> 00:19:19.586
Cheer up!

00:19:20.155 --> 00:19:23.314
Candy, are you going to welcome me
with a knife?

00:19:23.464 --> 00:19:24.849
To have a cut here.

00:19:25.299 --> 00:19:27.592
There won't be any surgeries,
don't worry.

00:19:27.829 --> 00:19:29.490
Please.

00:19:31.633 --> 00:19:33.191
Father.

00:19:37.205 --> 00:19:38.399
Sorry.

00:19:38.807 --> 00:19:42.534
Excuse me,
which way is to the town's church?

00:19:42.684 --> 00:19:44.402
This way.

00:19:44.552 --> 00:19:46.276
Thank you!

00:19:51.286 --> 00:19:54.778
God, please protect Father!

00:20:04.065 --> 00:20:06.659
- Father!
- Open the door of the next room.

00:20:14.976 --> 00:20:17.285
Candy, Father...

00:20:17.435 --> 00:20:19.607
Fainted after the examination.

00:20:20.215 --> 00:20:21.876
That serious?

00:20:22.117 --> 00:20:23.812
Because of this.

00:20:24.152 --> 00:20:25.585
Whiskey?

00:20:25.820 --> 00:20:29.777
Mr. Steve was nervous about
seeing the doctor, and he drank a lot.

00:20:29.927 --> 00:20:31.250
Father!

00:20:31.400 --> 00:20:35.056
His heart is ok,
he just needs some rest.

00:20:37.866 --> 00:20:41.025
Really?
I am going to work harder for Father.

00:20:41.175 --> 00:20:42.603
Cheer up, Tom!

00:20:43.738 --> 00:20:46.599
Sorry, I have other patients.

00:20:46.749 --> 00:20:48.336
Thank you, Candy!

00:20:53.881 --> 00:20:58.648
Candy is back to her busy life again.

00:21:00.955 --> 00:21:06.325
At the same time,
Cookie returned to the port.

